 as whether to download headers or messages, size limits on downloaded messages, behavior online vs. offline, and time interval for connecting to the server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148352">Send/Receive group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541827">група за слање/пријем</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="154_543576_1669452"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of the Administrators group on the local server computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="543576">server administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1669452">администратор сервера</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15419_140417_2541759"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any sequence of characters with a valid format that is surrounded by number signs (#). Valid formats include the date format specified by the locale settings for your code or the universal date format.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140417">date literal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541759">литерал датума</ter