ment that share a common database, directory database, or tree and that is administered as a unit with common rules and procedures, which can include security policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47604">domain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1504460">домена</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16113_47604_2541474"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A uniquely-named collection of computers in a networked environment that share a common database, directory database, or tree and that is administered as a unit with common rules and procedures, which can include security policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47604">domain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541474">домен</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16114_530294_2521290"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flat board made of nonconducting material, such as plastic or fiberglass where chips and other electronic components are mounted, usually in predrilled holes. The component holes are connected electrically by predefined conductive metal pathways that are printed on the surface of the board. The metal leads protruding from the electronic components are soldered to the conductive metal pathways to form a connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="530294">printed circuit board</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521290">штампана плоча</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16114_530295_2521290"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flat board made of nonconducting material, such as plastic or fiberglass where chips and other electronic components are mounted, usually in predrilled holes. The component holes are connected electrically by predefined conductive metal pathways that are printed on the surface of the board. The metal leads protruding from the electronic components are soldered to the conductive metal pathways to form a connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="530295">PCB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521290">штампана плоча</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16119_329894_1504461"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A request for payment for products and/or services sold.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="329894">bill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:la