e">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2105_545690_1916926"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that shows text formatting and a simplified page layout.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="545690">draft view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1916926">приказ скице</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2105_545690_2527782"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that shows text formatting and a simplified page layout.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="545690">draft view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2527782">приказ радне верзије</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21053_766415_1504616"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A disk image provided for use in repairing or reinstalling an installation of Windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="766415">recovery image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig><