rable standard for government and industry.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767324">Suite B</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1917029">Пакет Б</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21212_767327_1504639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of software to support customer-preferred algorithms for encryption, hashing, entropy and digital signatures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767327">cryptographic agility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1504639">криптографска способност</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21212_767327_1504640"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability of software to support customer-preferred algorithms for encryption, hashing, entropy and digital signatures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767327">cryptographic agility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1504640">крипто способност</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</te