es or disables the playing of a sound when a nudge is received.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767338">Nudge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1051305">Продрмавање прозора</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21227_767357_1944752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security feature that validates files before allowing them to be loaded by the application, in order to protect against file format vulnerabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767357">Office File Validation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944752">провјера ваљаности Office фајла</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21227_767357_2527910"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security feature that validates files before allowing them to be loaded by the application, in order to protect against file format vulnerabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767357">Office File Validation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2527910">Провера ваљаности Office датотека</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21244_767583_1504643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows end users and IT admins to control which file types and versions can be opened and saved in the application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767583">File Block</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1504643">фајл блок</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21244_767583_2527912"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows end users and IT admins to control which file types and versions can be opened and saved in the application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767583">File Block</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2527912">Блокирање датотека</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21253_767590_1504644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to superimpose a dot over a presentation and control its position with 