enger is available via a desktop app, on the web (no installation needed), and on mobile devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1667486">Messenger</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678880">Messenger</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="24569_1135487_1167157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop email program that lets users manage multiple email accounts, newsgroups, and feeds in one place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1135487">Windows Live Mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1167157">Windows Live Пошта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2458_377950_1796385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A space, shown onscreen as a box, that contains a particular element of your publication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="377950">frame</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796385">оквир</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Mascul