1275614">User Profile service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523775">Услуга корисничких профила</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26519_1275617_1523707"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service over which the administration (that is all the methods necessary to control the Search service, such as starting content source index crawls, updating scopes, etc.) of the Microsoft Office SharePoint Search service takes place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275617">Search Administration Web Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1523707">Веб услуга администрације претраге</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26522_1275648_1778480"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The messaging system that an administrator runs on their own servers in their own company as compared to a messaging system that is run in the cloud (hosted).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275648">on-premises messaging system</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1778480">локални систем за ра