 connected to the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358013">remote user</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2388757">удаљени корисник</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26894_1358510_2794512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A technology used by Exchange to store user mailboxes and folders. A store consists of a rich-text database (.edb), plus a streaming native Internet content database (.stm).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1358510">store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794512">складиште</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26910_1359035_1683413"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of authenticating a user based on a set of claims about the user's identity contained in a trusted token. This token is often issued and signed by an entity that is able to authenticate the user by other means, and that is trusted by the entity doing the claims-based authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1359035">claims-based authentication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1683413">пријављивање уз помоћ токена</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2692_233482_609636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A notification that an email message was not delivered to the recipient.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233482">non-delivery report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="609636">извештај о неиспоручивању</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2692_233483_609636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A notification that an email message was not delivered to the recipient.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="233483">NDR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="609636">извештај о неиспоручивању</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26941_1359296_2611807"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A 4-byte value that maps to a filter in a filter key map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1359296">filter key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</