hicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3242_161308_2432668"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directed relationship between two objects, such as components, objects, or features. For example, if feature A depends on feature B, B is a dependency of A.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="161308">dependency</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432668">зависност</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32431_1678780_1684812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows for preservation of content documents, pages, and messages in Exchange and SharePoint so that when they are modified or deleted, the original version can still be accessed for electronic discovery and other legal purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678780">In-Place Hold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1684812">Чување оригинала</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32431_1678780_1917421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows for preservation of content documents, pages, and messages in Exchange and SharePoint so that when they are modified or deleted, the original version can still be accessed for electronic discovery and other legal purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678780">In-Place Hold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1917421">Чување на мјесту</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32432_1678824_1680660"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual interface where users enter a passcode, use a certain button combination or perform a certain gesture in order to activate the full functionality of a device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678824">lock screen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680660">екран закључавања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32432_1678824_2610560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual interface where users enter a passcode, use a certain button combination or perform a certain gesture in order to activate the full functionality of a device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1678824">lock screen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610560">закључани екран</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32434_1679570_1681003"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that allows users to upload email messages, email folders, and contacts from an email account on their PC to the cloud to facilitate access from multiple devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679570">Mail Migration add-on</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681003">Додатак Mail Migration</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32435_1679576_1708189"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique used to remove wobbled distortions from a video captured with a rolling shutter camera that's exposed to large accelerations or jitter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679576">wobble correction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1708189">исправљање дрхтања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32436_1679577_1708182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique that's used to reduce the appearance of camera shake in a video image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679577">anti-shake</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1708182">стабилизовање слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32436_1679577_1709117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique that's used to reduce the appearance of camera shake in a video image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679577">anti-shake</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709117">стабилизација слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32436_1679577_2076256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique that's used to reduce the appearance of camera shake in a video image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1679577">anti-shake</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2076256">функција стабилизација слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32436_1805606_1708182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique that's used to reduce the appearance of camera shake in a video image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805606">anti-shake feature</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1708182">стабилизовање слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32436_1805606_1709117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique that's used to reduce the appearance of camera shake in a video image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805606">anti-shake feature</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1709117">стабилизација слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32436_1805606_2076256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image stabilization technique that's used to reduce the appearance of camera shake in a video image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805606">anti-shake feature</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2076256">функција стабилизација слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32455_1680736_1684810"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office product that identifies business-critical Excel spreadsheets and Access databases by discovering files across network shares and SharePoint libraries, and that provides flexible risk assessment and categorization based on relevance, materiality and business impact.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680736">Discovery and Risk Assessment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1684810">Откривање и процена ризика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32456_1680737_1684815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office product that provides interactive diagnostics to identify errors, deviations from spreadsheet best practices and insights into data flow in and out of the spreadsheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680737">Spreadsheet Inquire</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1684815">Контрола унакрсне табеле</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32457_1680739_1684814"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office product that detects and categorizes changes between two spreadsheets to facilitate review and approval processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680739">Spreadsheet Compare</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1684814">Поређење унакрсних табела</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32458_1680740_1684809"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office product that detects and categorizes changes between two databases to facilitate review and approval processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680740">Database Compare</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1684809">Поређење база података</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32459_1680741_1684807"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office product that provides non-intrusive auditing of changes made to Excel spreadsheets and Access databases, and supports alerts, notifications and automatic workflows based on user activities such as macro or formula changes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1680741">Audit and Control Management Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1684807">Сервер за надгледање и управљање садржајем</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32464_1681335_1761078"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Denotes the experience with Lync that can be scheduled, or ad-hoc. A Lync Meeting provides the ability to interact with people through video, audio, instant messaging, and content sharing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681335">Lync Meeting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761078">Lync састанак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32466_1681337_1761111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Alerts to Lync users about the quality of the network, computer, camera, and lighting conditions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681337">video quality notifications</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761111">обавештења о квалитету видеа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32468_1681339_1761093"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that lets users create and share OneNote meeting notes in a Lync Meeting. Notes appear as docked in a Lync Meeting, with participant lists that can be updated in meeting notes for participants to see.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681339">OneNote share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761093">дељење OneNote бележака</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32470_1681341_1761097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video preview for a Lync user that provides options to answer with video from within the notification.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681341">personal preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761097">лични претходни преглед</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32471_1681352_1686757"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web browser component of Windows that provides a traditional and familiar browsing experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681352">Internet Explorer for the desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1686757">Internet Explorer за рачунаре</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32472_1681353_1687080"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The touch-optimized, immersive web browser for Windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681353">Internet Explorer 10</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1687080">Internet Explorer 10</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32485_1681572_1761062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of Lync Meeting host and presenter controls that optimizes for the type of meeting, size of audience, content, and/or video sources available to participants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681572">enhanced presenter controls</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761062">побољшане контроле за излагача</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32486_1681573_1761079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Denotes the Conversation window that handles escalations (peer-to-peer to conference) and scalable views that display people and content together inside a Lync Meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681573">Lync Meeting window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761079">прозор Lync састанка</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32488_1681575_1761096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of chat in which messages are posted to a chat room where they can be viewed and responded to in real time by multiple participants. Users can search for other rooms by name, member/owner, keywords, and content across groups from Lync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681575">persistent chat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761096">непрекидно ћаскање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32489_1681576_1761100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu bar that appears beside the picture area of a contact in the Lync Contacts list that shows the available communication modes: IM, Call, Video, and View card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681576">Quick Lync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761100">Брзи Lync</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3249_141555_2541774"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A named attribute of a control, form, report, data access page, or section you use to respond to an associated event.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141555">event property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541774">својство догађаја</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32493_1681585_1761049"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Gives Lync system administrators the ability to monitor pools, servers, and networks across data centers through the public Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681585">active monitoring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761049">активно надгледање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32494_1681586_1764540"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Provides the ability to have softphone-based audio, video, and meetings (peer-to-peer and multiparty) without the problems of latency, jitter, and packet loss.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681586">Lync 2013 VDI plug-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1764540">додатна компонента Virtual Desktop Infrastructure (VDI) за Lync 2013</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32497_1681611_1761081"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Provide Lync Online administrators with the ability to run Lync Online PowerShell cmdlets and assign role-based access control (RBAC) roles to other administrators in the organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681611">Lync Online administrator controls</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761081">Lync Online администраторске контроле</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32506_1682131_1761101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A video compression standard that encodes high-quality video bitstreams. Support for the capability enables the conferencing server to determine how bitstreams should flow among receiving clients, based on the capabilities and bandwidth of the receiving endpoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1682131">Scalable Video Coding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1761101">Прилагодљиво кодирање видеа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32514_1683435_1777694"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Restricts the client versions that are used in a Lync Server environment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1683435">client version filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1777694">филтер за верзије клијента</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32516_1683438_1730247"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of Front End Servers, configured identically, that work together to provide services for a common group of users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1683438">Front End pool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1730247">група изложених сервера</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32519_1683444_1756032"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number assigned to a parked call by the Call Park application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1683444">Call Park orbit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1756032">орбита Паркирања позива</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32522_2016016_2029119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A document service that enables organizations to provision and manage online storage for their users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2016016">OneDrive for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2029119">OneDrive for Business</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected<