ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37266_2114005_2120237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in a file or folder Properties dialog box that allows the user to set, view, change, or remove file and folder permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114005">Security tab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2120237">картица „Безбедност“</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37266_2114005_2180638"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in a file or folder Properties dialog box that allows the user to set, view, change, or remove file and folder permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114005">Security tab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2180638">картица „Безбједност“</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37267_2114067_2120204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the Store that contains a selection of products presented to the customer in a group. The products may be purchased individually.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114067">Collections</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote>