hicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37579_2144336_2710577"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A profile on a social network that is owned and maintained by one or more individuals within Microsoft Social Engagement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144336">social profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2710577">профил за друштвене мреже</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37580_2144338_2147090"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Lumia Camera, the feature that allows users to create high-definition photos and videos by capturing a short, high-definition video recording.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144338">Lumia Moments</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147090">Lumia Moments</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37581_2144339_2147097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Lumia Camera, one or more frames of video that can be used to create a special image type such as a Living Image or action shot.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144339">moment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147097">тренутак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37582_2144340_2147092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that allows the user to capture multiple images simultaneously with different focus settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144340">Lumia Refocus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147092">Lumia Refocus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37583_2144341_2147094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for capturing, editing, and sharing photos of oneself that can be automatically enhanced with various effects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144341">Lumia Selfie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147094">Lumia Selfie</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37584_2144342_2147104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A photo that one has taken of oneself, normally using a smartphone or a digital camera, that is planned to be uploaded to a social media website.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144342">selfie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147104">селфи</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37585_2354826_2147100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows the camera to capture multiple shots at different flash and exposure settings, so that the user can shoot first and edit and select the perfect shot later. The resulting photo is produced by merging multiple images to produce different lighting effects, similar to HDR or blended flash.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354826">Rich HDR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2147100">обогаћен снимак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37586_2144610_2147129"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that invokes the Start menu (desktop) and the Start screen (mobile or desktop).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termG