Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37887_2168872_2171113"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element in Outlook that shows options that allows users to broaden or narrow email searches.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2168872">Search refiner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2171113">Прецизније претраживање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37887_2168872_2213808"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element in Outlook that shows options that allows users to broaden or narrow email searches.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2168872">Search refiner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2213808">Детаљна претрага</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37888_2168875_2171111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The pane that functions as a centralized location where Office 365 for Business users can view all of their missed system events, and that is accessible through one entry point in the navigation bar and shows up in the flex pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2168875">notification pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2171111">окно за обавештења</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37889_2168877_2171110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of authentication mechanisms which includes authenticating users with both on-premises and cloud-hosted Office services, single sign-on authentication (including against third party identity providers) so that passwords are not sent directly to Office 365, and multi-factor authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2168877">modern authentication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2171110">модерна потврда идентитета</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37889_2168877_2213804"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of authentication mechanisms which includes authenticating users with both on-premises and cloud-hosted Office services, single sign-on authentication (including against third party identity providers) so that passwords are not sent directly to Office 365, and multi-factor authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2168877">modern authentication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2213804">скуп механизама за провјеру</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3789_90732_1916612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of query that, when you run it, prompts for values (criteria) to use to select the records for the result set so that the same query can be used to retrieve different result sets.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="90732">parameter query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1916612">параметарски упит</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37890_2168878_2171112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The API that enables developers to create, read, update, and delete objects and relationships between them in an Office graph.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2168878">Office Graph API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2171112">Office Graph API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37899_2169164_2685448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The attack method where the attacker steals the hashed credentials of a user (or a computer) in order to authenticate, via NTLM, to various resources within the same network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2169164">Pass-the-Hash</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685448">Pass-the-Hash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37899_2169165_2685448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The attack method where the attacker steals the hashed credentials of a user (or a computer) in order to authenticate, via NTLM, to various resources within the same network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2169165">PtH</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685448">Pass-the-Hash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="379_102150_1356293"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Not in the immediate vicinity, as a computer or other device located in another place (room, building, or city) and accessible through some type of cable or communications link.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><term