r</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38597_2244480_2250329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Sway card that takes a set of cards and creates a group out of them with a particular visualization pattern.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244480">group card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250329">група картица</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38598_2244481_2250444"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The gallery that holds all the Style options that can be applied to a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244481">Style gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250444">Галерија стилова</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38599_2244483_2250326"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option that shows the set of fonts that can be applied to a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244483">Font choices</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250326">Палета фонтова</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="386_93737_1502774"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hardware- or software-based interface used to transfer information between a computer and other devices. Hardware ports are physical connections that are visible on the outside of the computer. Software ports are the numbered gateways in programs that software programs use to exchange information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="93737">port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1502774">прикључак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38600_2244485_2250325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Design feature that allows users to save particular Designs, Styles, or Structures for easy use or access later.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244485">Favorites</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250325">Омиљено</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38601_2244486_2250455"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The navigation layout that presents content in a single column on the page and that allows user to navigate from top to bottom.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244486">Vertical</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250455">Вертикално</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38602_2244487_2250416"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Structure that places content along the horizontal axis and allows users to navigate through it from left and right.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244487">Panorama</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250416">Панорама</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38603_2244846_2250319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway feature that allows a user to click on an embedded image to see any of the following: a high resolution version of it, a link to where the image was found, as well as related images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244846">Detail view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250319">Приказ детаља</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38604_2244850_2266150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button on the Sway home page that allows the user to begin using sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244850">Get Started!</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2266150">Почнимо са радом!</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38605_2244852_2250307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that allows users to create a bulleted list out of their text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244852">Bulleted list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2250307">Листа са знаковима за набрајање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38625_2244876_2250335"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that allows users to create a numbered list out of their text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244876">Numbered list</term