pe="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3888_25223_1503184"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A communication line used for data transfer among the components of a computer system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25223">bus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503184">сабирница</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38880_2259632_2260746"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Store for Business and Education Store, to get apps and other digital goods into the hands of employees or students.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259632">distribute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2260746">дистрибуирати</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38880_2259632_2261189"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Store for Business and Education Store, to get apps and other digital goods into the hands of employees or students.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259632">distribute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2261189">дистрибуирати</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38882_2259634_2260748"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets customers extend their gaming experience across multiple devices, play with other users, and show off scores and achievements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259634">game hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2260748">чвориште за игре</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38883_2259635_2260749"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The default browser in Windows 10, which provides a more interoperable, reliable, and discoverable experience with advanced features including the ability to annotate on web pages, a distraction-free reading experience, and integration of Cortana. Also available on iOS and Android.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259635">Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2260749">Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38884_2259636_2260752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The source location of files that are stored on OneDrive and not synced to the local device. This is different from other OneDrive files (just called "OneDrive"), where a copy is synced and stored locally as well as in the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259636">OneDrive (cloud only)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2260752">OneDrive (само у облаку)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38885_2259637_2261205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user role within Windows Store for Business that allows the user to acquire apps from Windows Store for Business on behalf of his company.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259637">purchaser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2261205">купац</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38886_2259638_2260755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view of a set of photos that displays them one at a time, sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259638">slideshow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2260755">пројекција</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38887_2259809_2260751"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section in the Settings app for Windows 10 desktop, containing network and Internet settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259809">Network &amp; Internet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2260751">Мрежа и интернет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38890_2259820_2339444"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The stages in the lifespan of a product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259820">lifecycle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2339444">животни циклус</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38892_2897506_2954800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft cloud-based filtering system that detects and blocks malicious files, attac