eraction and Structure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2399532">Layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281758">Начин кретања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39210_2399532_2406097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway panel that gives users a set of options for changing their sway’s interaction and Structure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2399532">Layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2406097">Распоред</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39210_2399532_2406100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway panel that gives users a set of options for changing their sway’s interaction and Structure.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2399532">Layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2406100">Распоред начина кретања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39211_2276525_2281790"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process where an organization defines a subset of employee communications that must be reviewed by an audit group, to ensure that the organization is complying with all relevant laws, regulations, and policies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2276525">Supervisory Review</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281790">Супервизорски преглед</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39212_2276526_2281788"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of Sway features that are driven by an intelligence platform and that makes suggestions on how to edit, use, or add content based on what’s in the user’s sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2276526">Suggested</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281788">Предлози</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39213_2276529_2281755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint site that allows users to publish a collection of responsive pages with embedded document references and organize them with a cover page and permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2276529">microsite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281755">микросајт</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39214_2276647_2665314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specific package that is made available to a selected set of end users. Often used to validate functionality or behavior before the product official release.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2276647">flight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2665314">пробни пакет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39214_2328190_2665314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specific package that is made available to a selected set of end users. Often used to validate functionality or behavior before the product official release.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2328190">package flight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2665314">пробни пакет</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39218_2276748_2277515"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The services which provide automatic synchronization of user and group accounts on-premise and to the accounts stored in Azure Active Directory via pass-back through federation and password hash synchronization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2276748">Azure Active Directory identity synchronization tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277515">алатке за синхронизацију идентитета за Azure Active Directory</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39229_2277489_2281747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Structure and Style choice for a sway that is initially made by the user, which Sway will remember and intelligently implement based upon content, prior behavior, and abstract expressions of intent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277489">design lever</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281747">ручица за дизајнирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3923_215040_2701421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A common interface between transport-level applications, such as Microsoft Remote Procedure Call (RPC), and security support providers (SSPs), such as Windows Distributed Security. SSPI allows a transport application to call one of the SSPs to obtain an authenticated connection. These calls do not require extensive knowledge of the security protocol's details.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="215040">Security Support Provider Interface</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2701421">SSPI</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3923_215041_2701421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A common interface between transport-level applications, such as Microsoft Remote Procedure Call (RPC), and security support providers (SSPs), such as Windows Distributed Security. SSPI allows a transport application to call one of the SSPs to obtain an authenticated connection. These calls do not require extensive knowledge of the security protocol's details.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="215041">SSPI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2701421">SSPI</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39252_2277604_2354191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component based on the Microsoft SQL Server Database Engine that can validate the syntax and semantics of DDL statements with the same fidelity as a Microsoft SQL Server Database engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277604">Transact-SQL Compiler Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354191">Компајлерска услуга за Microsoft SQL Server 2014 Transact-SQL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39252_2277605_2354191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component based on the Microsoft SQL Server Database Engine that can validate the syntax and semantics of DDL statements with the same fidelity as a Microsoft SQL Server Database engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277605">T-SQL Compiler Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354191">Компајлерска услуга за Microsoft SQL Server 2014 Transact-SQL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39252_2353951_2354191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component based on the Microsoft SQL Server Database Engine that can validate the syntax and semantics of DDL statements with the same fidelity as a Microsoft SQL Server Database engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><ter