descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SSIS transform that takes a single input and distributes the incoming rows to one or more outputs uniformly via multithreading in a round robin fashion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2304643">BDD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2306806">Балансирани дистрибутер података</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39496_2304644_2306820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The stateless, synchronous service that receives messages from the on-premise instance of SQL Server and generates a self-signed SSL certificate as part of its first run to run as a Local System account, a configuration file to configure itself, and a Windows Firewall rule to allow its incoming TCP connections at default port 11435.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2304644">Cloud Adapter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2306820">Адаптер за облак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39497_2304645_2307180"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An authentication mechanism that allows a security token service (STS) in one trust domain to delegate user authentication to an identity provider in another trust do