ed to a case. The service contract a customer purchases determines the service level for its associated cases.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="216926">Gold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="765596">Gold</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4090_81456_1503209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keyboard key that, when pressed (and held), changes the actions of ordinary input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81456">modifier key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503209">модификаторски тастер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4092_817_1503210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To transfer a copy of a file from a remote device to a requesting device by means of a modem or network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="817">download</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503210">преузети</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="gr