ld" in some form to the user. Such a program is often created as an example, to introduce the basic syntax of a programming language to students or others new to that language.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2465102">Hello World</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469002">Здраво, свијете</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43628_2781062_2783714"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for OneDrive for Business that includes Office Online and that is available through the User purchase subscription program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781062">OneDrive for Business with Office on the web (user purchased)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2783714">OneDrive for Business са пакетом Office на вебу (купио корисник)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43628_2781062_2785160"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for OneDrive for Business that includes Office Online and that is available through the User purchase subscription program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781062">OneDrive for Business with Office on the web (user purchased)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech"