 information on those deals are displayed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488671">Focused</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497553">У фокусу</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44290_2488792_2497546"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The field in Outlook Customer Manager that holds the negotiable amount the provider will receive for a deal and which is finalized once the deal is closed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488792">Deal amount</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497546">Износ посла</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44291_2488793_2497550"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The field in Outlook Customer Manager that records the number of deals that did not go through as well as their sum.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488793">Deals lost</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497550">Изгубљени послови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNo