 Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499494">Stretch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499495">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44355_2493977_2511948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for a collection of configuration settings file with extension .ppkg. Provisioning packages are simple enough that with a short set of written instructions, a student or non-technical employee can use them to configure their device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493977">provisioning package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511948">пакет за додељивање привилегија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44355_2493977_2511959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for a collection of configuration settings file with extension .ppkg. Provisioning packages are simple enough that with a short set of written instructions, a student or non-technical employee can use them to configure their device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493977">provisioning package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511959">пакет за додјељивање привилегија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44356_2493981_2511951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The academic disciplines of science, technology, engineering and mathematics, used when addressing education policy and curriculum choices in schools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493981">STEM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511951">МИНТ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44357_2493985_2511946"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative work space, tool, app, or program for making, learning, exploring and sharing. It can refer to a literal space or place, or to digital environments where people are encouraged to create and share with a community.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493985">makerspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511946">ствараоница</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44358_2493987_2511943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test with important consequences for the test taker or which is the basis of a major decision.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493987">high-stakes testing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511943">одлучујућа провера знања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44358_2493987_2511954"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test with important consequences for the test taker or which is the basis of a major decision.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493987">high-stakes testing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511954">одлучујућа провјера знања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44360_2496992_2502610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The portal where admins in educational institutions can acquire and distribute apps for their students, faculty, and staff to use.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2496992">Microsoft Store for Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2502610">Microsoft Store за образовање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44373_2499534_2501539"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the year 2016 edition of Project Standard that is for PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499534">Microsoft Project Standard 2016 for PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501539">Microsoft Project Standard 2016 за PC рачунаре</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44374_2499535_2501538"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for the year 2016 editi