ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44586_2506886_2511944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An app that enables members of a Language community to provide translation and language-related feedback about features. The app is currently available only for Windows Desktop.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506886">Language Community app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511944">апликација „Језичка заједница“</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44587_2506888_2511945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A request to gather and send language feedback using quests in Feedback Hub and the Language Community app.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2506888">language quest</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2511945">језички задатак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4459_148656_1944762"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The slide that stores information about the design template applied, including font styles, placeholder sizes and positions, background design, and color schemes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148656">slide master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1944762">прототип слајда</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4459_148656_2527589"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The slide that stores information about the design template applied, including font styles, placeholder sizes and positions, background design, and color schemes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148656">slide master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2527589">мастер слајда</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44608_2573054_2577601"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section of the expanded view of the profile card that contains LinkedIn profile information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2573054">LinkedIn profile in Microsoft</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2577601">LinkedIn профил у Microsoft производима</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44611_2509173_2513214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to compose and save a message as a template, and then reuse it when they want to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509173">Email templates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2513214">Предлошци е-поште</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44611_2509173_2515093"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to compose and save a message as a template, and then reuse it when they want to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2509173">Email templates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515093">Обрасци е-поште</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44619_2512050_2514377"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides a notification feed where you can view all your notifications in one place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512050">notification center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2514377">центар за обавештења</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4462_72367_1503251"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The core of layered architecture that manages the most basic operations of the operating system and the computer's processor. The kernel schedules different blocks of executing code, called threads, for the processor to keep it as busy as possible and coordinates multiple processors to optimize performance. The kernel also synchronizes activities among Executive-level subcomponents, such as I/O Manager and Process Manager, and handles hardware exceptions and other hardware-dependent functions. The kernel works closely with the hardware abstraction layer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72367">kernel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503251">језгро</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44620_2512194_2514409"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that converts spoken words to text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512194">speech to text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2514409">претварање говора у текст</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44621_2512198_2514349"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report optimized for mobile devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512198">mobile report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2514349">извештај за мобилне уређаје</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44624_2512211_2514345"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visualization mode that allows you to expand a dashboard tile or report visual to see more details.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512211">focus mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2514345">режим фокусирања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44626_2512224_2514386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power BI offering that allows you to view dashboards that you created.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2512224">Power BI Basic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet