a person's identity from being connected with information pertaining to him/her.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661375">de-identification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2663096">деидентификација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47293_2661378_2663098"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft-wide initiative to provide users a consistent, easy-to-understand, and easy-to-use experiences that lets them view and control the personal data that Microsoft collects from them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661378">Next Generation Privacy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2663098">Нова генерација заштите приватности</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47293_2661380_2663098"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft-wide initiative to provide users a consistent, easy-to-understand, and easy-to-use experiences that lets them view and control the personal data that Microsoft collects from them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2661380">NextGen Privacy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lan