="definition">An approach to machine translation that uses an artificial neural network to predict the likelihood of a sequence of words, typically modeling entire sentences in a single integrated model.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839428">NMT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841711">NMT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50188_2839431_2841700"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Excel that records actions performed on an Excel sheet and saves them to a script. Henceforth, the actions can be performed automatically by running the script.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839431">Action Recorder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841700">Снимач радњи</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50189_2839432_2841713"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Name of an Excel dialog used to start the the Action Recorder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839432">Record Actions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841713">Сними радње</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50190_2839434_2841706"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Name of a feature in Excel that allows users to edit scripts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839434">Code Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841706">Уређивач кода</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50192_2839466_2862178"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Related to Microsoft integrated marketing campaigns that align the sales, marketing, and services teams of Microsoft and its partners to address a common customer need.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839466">go-to-market</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2862178">припрема за излазак на тржиште</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50194_2839796_2841702"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool used to set a Yammer network to native mode, to address any network incompatibilities, to provide information on the quantity and usage of private unlisted groups in the network, and other functions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839796">Alignment Tool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841702">Алатка за усклађивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50195_2839821_2841701"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report that provides information about the quantity and usage of external groups, files previously uploaded in private messages, the activity of network guests, and other information a Yammer network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839821">Alignment Report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841701">Извештај о усклађивању</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50196_2839890_3110939"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that shares the controller role with another entity to ensure GDPR compliance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839890">co-controller</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3110939">заједнички руковалац</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50196_2839891_3110939"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that shares the controller role with another entity to ensure GDPR compliance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839891">joint controller</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3110939">заједнички руковалац</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50197_2839915_2841712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The processing of personal data in such a manner that the personal data can no longer be attributed to a specific data subject without the use of additional information, provided that such additional information is kept separately and is subject to technical and organisational measures to ensure that the personal data are not attributed to an identified or identifiable natural person.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839915">pseudonymisation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841712">псеудонимизација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50197_2839918_2841712"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The processing of personal data in such a manner that the personal data can no longer be attributed to a specific data subject without the use of additional information, provided that such additional information is kept separately and is subject to technical and organisational measures to ensure that the personal data are not attributed to an identified or identifiable natural person.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2839918">pseudonymization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841712">псеудонимизација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50211_2841168_2844539"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field in which values are dropped.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841168">bucket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844539">контејнер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50211_2841168_2844553"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field in which values are dropped.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841168">bucket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><