ick up the call gets the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841766">attendant routing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843561">усмјеравање путем послужитеља</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50222_2841766_2844732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a call queue, a method of sending calls to agents whereby the first call in the queue rings all call agents at the same time. The first call agent to pick up the call gets the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841766">attendant routing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844732">стандардно усмеравање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50231_2842090_2845378"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove marked-up documents or data from a machine learning system and from the training process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842090">unseed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2845378">одстранити</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><t