onitor chats and texts, manage screen time, and perform other functions related to controlling and reporting on that phone's activities, usually with the aim towards making the phone safer to use by children.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2887249">phone monitoring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2888433">надзор телефона</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5117_262544_1503346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual effect that imparts a quality of translucency to windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262544">glass</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503346">стакло</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5117_262544_1503347"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual effect that imparts a quality of translucency to windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262544">glass</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503347">прозирни обод</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelecte