 that uses artificial intelligence to produce meaningful phrases and sentences from structured data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2887905">NLG</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2895397">генерисање природног језика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51180_2887906_2895403"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A capability that makes it easier for you to zoom into the content in your screen on your phone or tablet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2887906">pinch and zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2895403">зумирање примицањем прстију</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5119_319158_1503348"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The distance or period of time between a specified start point and a specified end point. For example, the length of an audio or video clip is usually measured in minutes and seconds.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319158">length</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503348">дужина</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="512_14369_1796356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of chart that displays the trend of values over time or categories. By displaying the sum of the plotted values, an area chart also shows the relationship of parts to a whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="14369">area chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796356">просторни графикон</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="512_14369_2527330"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of chart that displays the trend of values over time or categories. By displaying the sum of the plotted values, an area chart also shows the relationship of parts to a whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="14369">area chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2527330">обласни графикон</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5121_73528_1916602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of symbolic resolution where a symbol is resolved to a specific software routine during program execution instead of during program compilation, enabling polymorphism in object-oriented programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73528">late binding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1916602">касно повезивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5121_73528_2541501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of symbolic resolution where a symbol is resolved to a specific software routine during program execution instead of during program compilation, enabling polymorphism in object-oriented programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73528">late binding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541501">касно повезивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5121_73529_1916602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of symbolic resolution where a symbol is resolved to a specific software routine during program execution instead of during program compilation, enabling polymorphism in object-oriented programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73529">dynamic binding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1916602">касно повезивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5121_73529_2541501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of symbolic resolution where a symbol is resolved to a specific software routine during program execution instead of during program compilation, enabling polymorphism in object-oriented programs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73529">dynamic binding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541501">касно повезивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51221_2889262_2890028"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column that is not associated with an of XML schema.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889262">untyped column</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2890028">нетипизирана колона</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51222_2889280_2889991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to update only the data that has changed in order to improve the speed of refresh for large tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889280">incremental refresh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889991">инкрементално освежавање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51223_2889289_2889996"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To divide two numbers and return the integer part of the result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889289">integer-divide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889996">целобројно поделити</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51226_2889300_2889990"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cluster that contains data points that belong to multiple clusters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889300">fuzzy cluster</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889990">мешовити кластер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51227_2889301_2889993"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column that creates an index to your table, working as a row counter to your data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889301">index column</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889993">колона индекса</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51228_2889302_2889988"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of unique values in a column.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889302">distinct count</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889988">број јединствених вредности</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5123_26059_1503349"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To store frequently used data values in a special memory subsystem for quick access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26059">cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503349">кеширати</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51236_2889600_2890411"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that limits battery charging capacity to 50%, which slows the aging process and prolongs battery longevity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889600">Battery Limit Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2890411">Режим ограничења батерије</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51236_2889600_2891021"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that limits battery charging capacity to 50%, which slows the aging process and prolongs battery longevity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2889600">Battery Limit Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2891021">режим ограничења батерије</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51237_2889601_2890410"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that helps protect a battery from the cumulative negative effects of consistent and recurrent use at high temperatures or high states of charge by monitoring battery conditions continuously and implementing 