ormality in your time series data that is detected with machine learning.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896348">anomaly</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896862">аномалија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51414_2896349_2896868"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A dataflow that combines, transforms, and build reports based on streaming data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896349">streaming dataflow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896868">ток података за стримовање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51415_2896350_2896867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A temporary anomaly in a time series event stream that represents a sharp increase in quantity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896350">spike</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896867">скок</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51416_2896351_2896864"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A temporary anomaly in a time series event stream that represents a sharp decrease in quantity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896351">dip</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896864">пад</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51429_2897500_2897646"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To pin or lock an individual video feed for all attendees in a Teams meeting regardless of who is currently talking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897500">spotlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897646">издвојити</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51447_2898061_2898132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox subscription service through which users can pay a monthly fee towards the purchase of an Xbox console plus Xbox Game Pass Ultimate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898061">Xbox All Access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="