 post thoughts and share ideas that are not confined to a specific community or event, allowing users to share their expertise on any subject of their choosing, build their personal brand within the company, or promote ideas and events that apply to more than one community, or even the entire network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007457">storyline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008349">лични простор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52952_3007458_3008336"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An add-on with two associated SKUs that enables Microsoft 365 customers to store their Microsoft 365 user data at rest in their local geography at the tenant level​.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007458">Advanced Data Residency Plan 1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008336">План за напредно складиштење података 1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52953_3007459_3008337"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An add-on with two associated SKUs that enables Microsoft 365 customers to store their Microsoft 365 user data at rest in their local geography at the user account level​.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007459">Advanced Data Residency Plan 2</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008337">План за напредно складиштење података 2</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52954_3079521_3080649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that enables organizations to use a single SIM-enabled number for Teams Phone serving as desk phone number, mobile number and Teams number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3079521">Microsoft Teams Phone Mobile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080649">Microsoft Teams мобилна телефонија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52955_3007461_3008352"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in the M365 Compliance Center used by customers to look up individuals as part of a Data Subject Access Request (DSAR), most commonly in response to a GDPR or CCPA data access request.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007461">user data search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008352">претраживање корисничких података</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52956_3007463_3008346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in PowerPoint and Microsoft Teams that leverages AI to help professionals, students, and even those who just want to practice a speech for a wedding or graduation by providing users with feedback on their pace, use of monotone pitch, use of filler words, grammar, lack of originality, use of sensitive phrases, and more while they rehearse their presentations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007463">Speaker coach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008346">тренер за говор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52957_3007464_3008338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in Microsoft Teams for Education that allows educators to view, grade, and return routine student work and allows students to view their assignments and routine grades.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007464">Grades</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008338">Оцене</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52957_3007464_3008467"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in Microsoft Teams for Education that allows educators to view, grade, and return routine student work and allows students to view their assignments and routine grades.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007464">Grades</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008467">Оцјене</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52960_3010666_3011508"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Describes an object, such as a file or email, that has been inspected and found to not contain any harmful or potentially harmful content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3010666">no threats found</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3011508">нису пронађене претње</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5297_107243_1503369"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To write data (typically a file) to a storage medium.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="107243">save</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503369">сачувати</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52979_3011592_3011744"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view in PowerPoint that allows users to read notes, which are hidden from the presentation, when a user is recording a video of their PowerPoint presentation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3011592">Teleprompter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3011744">Телепромптер</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5298_9459_1503370"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of contact information for particular individuals, groups or organizations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="9459">address book</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503370">адресар</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52980_3011955_3012302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphical control element in the form of a progress bar that shows playback progress and allows the user to move backward/forward along a slider in order to rewind/fast-forward video playback or click on a point along the slider to move to a particular point in time of the recording.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3011955">seek bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012302">трака за тражење</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52981_3011956_3012300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The high-definition video format characterized by a display resolution of 1920x1080 pixels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3011956">Full HD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012300">Full HD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52982_3011957_3012301"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The duration of time in a music album or an audio disc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3011957">run time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012301">трајање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52984_3012061_3097552"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An add-on available to Microsoft Viva Insights subscribers, which provides additional capacity for usage of custom analysis tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012061">Microsoft Viva Insights Capacity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097552">Microsoft Viva Insights Capacity</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52989_3012675_3012726"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of the Calculator app that allows the user to store a figure for use in future calculations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012675">Memory</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012726">Меморија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52990_3012676_3014211"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Teams feature that allows a user to draw on and annotate an object on the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012676">Annotate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014211">Коментариши</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52991_3012677_3014223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link in Teams that allows a user to access information about a meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012677">Info</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014223">Информације</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52992_3012678_3014219"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link in Teams that allows a user to access and add applications like Forms or PowerApps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012678">Apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014219">Апликације</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52993_3012679_3014231"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The high-fidelity music mode in Teams that offers a richer sound experience when the user transmits music to listeners.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012679">Music</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014231">Музика</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52994_3012680_3014234"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link in Teams that allows users to access a participant roster which shows a list of people present in a meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012680">People</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3014234">Особе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53001_3012995_3013844"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An element that acts as supporting evidence that helps in increasing the confidence of the match. It can be a regular expression with or without a checksum validation, keyword list, keyword dictionary.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012995">supporting element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013844">пратећи елемент</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53002_3012997_3013840"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An incorrect or inappropriate configuration of an information system that put your system and data at risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012997">misconfiguration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013840">погрешна конфигурација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012998_3013841"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to the local part of your email address.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012998">plus addressing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013841">креирање адреса са знаком плус</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012998_3013842"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to the local part of your email address.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012998">plus addressing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013842">креирање подређених адреса</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012999_3013841"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to the local part of your email address.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012999">subaddressing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013841">креирање адреса са знаком плус</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53003_3012999_3013842"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to create a child email address or a disposable email address based on your standard email address, adding a "+"  suffix to the local part of your email address.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3012999">subaddressing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3013842">креирање подређених адреса</term><termNo