ly arranges meeting elements for optimal viewing by automatically adjusting the layout when people join, turn on the video, or present.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057911">Dynamic view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058803">Динамички приказ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53718_3057912_3058808"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Teams, a one-touch experience for joining third-party online meetings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057912">one-touch join</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058808">придруживање једним додиром</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53719_3057913_3058802"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in the Microsoft Teams calls app that allows users to combine calls together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057913">call merge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3058802">обједињавање позива</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><te