ation that helps users in Teams, Outlook, and Harmony stay in sync with each other on work progress and blockers at any time and in anyplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080858">Microsoft Check In</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083105">Check In</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54037_3080858_3083106"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 application that helps users in Teams, Outlook, and Harmony stay in sync with each other on work progress and blockers at any time and in anyplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080858">Microsoft Check In</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3083106">Microsoft Check In</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54037_3080860_3083105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 application that helps users in Teams, Outlook, and Harmony stay in sync with each other on work progress and blockers at any time and in anyplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080860">Check In</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl