raphics, applets, linked documents, and other items referred to in the HTML document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="396932">MHTML</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="406505">MHTML</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54130_3086105_3086857"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The add-on that offers 1 TB cloud storage for Microsoft 365 Personal and Family subscribers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086105">+1 TB Microsoft Storage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086857">+1 TB Microsoft складиштења</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54131_3086106_3086977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The color update to the Surface Pro keyboard with pen storage (Sapphire and Forest).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086106">Microsoft Surface Pro Signature Keyboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3086977">Тастатура Microsoft Surface Pro за потпис</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><