gular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54551_3099640_3100028"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The AI model that provides stock replenishment recommendations on when and how much stock users should reorder for a given item and warehouse location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099640">Restock recommendations</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100028">Препоруке за обнављање залиха</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54552_3099641_3100029"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A part of the route between two stop waypoints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099641">route leg</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100029">етапа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54553_3099642_3100031"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of a product which is available and the amount which is wanted by customers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099642">supply and demand</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100031">понуда и потражња</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54554_3099643_3100032"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The network of retailers, distributors, transporters, storage facilities and suppliers that participate in the sale, delivery and production of a particular product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099643">supply chain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100032">ланац снабдевања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54555_3099644_3100033"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cloud-based, modern planning solution that empowers organizations to build an agile, resilient, and sustainable supply chain fueled by intelligence and collaboration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099644">Supply chain planning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100033">Планирање ланца снабдевања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54557_3099738_3112903"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that removes a bad actor from the customer’s environment, builds resilience for future attacks, and mends defences after a cybersecurity incident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3099738">Microsoft Incident Response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3112903">Microsoft реаговање на инцидент</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54562_3100134_3100168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The secure, enterprise-grade solution that unlocks supply chain resiliency. It seamlessly unifies data from existing supply chain systems and ERPs into Microsoft Dataverse, where it is transformed to provide end to end visibility of the supply chain, generate actionable insights, and predict and mitigate potential disruptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100134">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100168">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54562_3100134_3100210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The secure, enterprise-grade solution that unlocks supply chain resiliency. It seamlessly unifies data from existing supply chain systems and ERPs into Microsoft Dataverse, where it is transformed to provide end to end visibility of the supply chain, generate actionable insights, and predict and mitigate potential disruptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100134">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100210">Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54562_3100135_3100168"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The secure, enterprise-grade solution that unlocks supply chain resiliency. It seamlessly unifies data from existing supply chain systems and ERPs into Microsoft Dataverse, where it is transformed to provide end to end visibility of the supply chain, generate actionable insights, and predict and mitigate potential disruptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100135">Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100168">Microsoft Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54562_3100135_3100210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The secure, enterprise-grade solution that unlocks supply chain resiliency. It seamlessly unifies data from existing supply chain systems and ERPs into Microsoft Dataverse, where it is transformed to provide end to end visibility of the supply chain, generate actionable insights, and predict and mitigate potential disruptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100135">Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100210">Supply Chain Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54564_3100233_3100607"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows organizations using Teams Phone to assign one calling plan across multiple users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100233">shared calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100607">дељено позивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54564_3100233_3100634"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows organizations using Teams Phone to assign one calling plan across multiple users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100233">shared calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100634">дијељено позивање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54565_3100234_3100610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Teams meetings that allows participants to augment their video stream with visual effects, such as make up, styles and frames.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100234">video filters</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100610">видео филтери</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54566_3100235_3100609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides a personal meeting stage configuration that keeps sign language interpreters and other signers in a consistent, central location with the highest available video quality throughout the meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100235">sign language view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100609">приказ за знаковни језик</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54567_3100236_3100606"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to create policies for specific priority users (C-Suite) that filter out unwanted communication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100236">priority account chat control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100606">контрола ћаскања за приоритетне налоге</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54568_3100237_3100604"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to customize backgrounds for licensed users in an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100237">organization meeting background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100604">позадина за састанке организације</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54569_3100238_3100605"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows IT admins to customize Together Mode scenes for licensed users in an organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100238">organization together mode scene</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100605">сцена за заједнички режим организације</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54580_3100695_3101199"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The retail media advertising platform that connects brands with the world's largest retailers and their active shoppers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100695">PromoteIQ</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101199">PromoteIQ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54581_3100752_3101196"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that integrates the most common PC/desktop management functions: virus inspection, trash cleaning, system repair/upgrade, system optimization, application management, pop-up blocking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100752">PC Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101196">Управљач рачунара</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54582_3100753_3101195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature within the PC Manager app that boosts PC performance by freeing memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100753">PC Boost</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101195">Боље перформансе рачунара</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54583_3100754_3101194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature within the PC Manager app that protects the operational system default browser settings from unexpected changes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3100754">Browser Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101194">Заштита прегледача</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54587_3113361_3114356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Entra product that enables securing and managing workloads, such as applications, service principals, managed identities and other software components that need to access cloud resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113361">Microsoft Entra Workload ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114356">Microsoft Entra Workload ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54587_3113361_3114357"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Entra product that enables securing and managing workloads, such as applications, service principals, managed identities and other software components that need to access cloud resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113361">Microsoft Entra Workload ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114357">Workload ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54587_3113362_3114356"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Entra product that enables securing and managing workloads, such as applications, service principals, managed identities and other software components that need to access cloud resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113362">Workload ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114356">Microsoft Entra Workload ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54587_3113362_3114357"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Entra product that enables securing and managing workloads, such as applications, service principals, managed identities and other software components that need to access cloud resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3113362">Workload ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114357">Workload ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54588_3101395_3102391"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The unity add-in that enables Microsoft Mesh users to upload custom environment templates to suit corporate events and meetings or create digital twins to match real-world environments in Mesh Spaces and Events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101395">Mesh Toolkit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3102391">Mesh комплет алатки</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54591_3101398_3102388"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A strategy for fact checking an unfamiliar online source by leaving the webpage and opening a new browser tab to see what additional websites say about the unknown source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101398">lateral reading</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3102388">латерално читање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54592_3101451_3101847"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A layout control which helps to lay out an array of objects in a predefined three-dimensional shape. It supports various surface styles, such as plane, cylinder, sphere, and radial. The radius and size of the objects and the space between them can be adjusted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101451">3D object collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101847">колекција 3D објеката</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54593_3101452_3101848"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Dynamics 365 Guides on HoloLens that allows user and remote collaborator annotate in the environment while on the call. Annotations are useful for pointing out different parts of the space, including parts that may be difficult or dangerous to reach. All call participants can see each others’ additions, and can make their own annotations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101452">annotation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101848">белешка</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54594_3101453_3101849"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An anchor in Dynamics 365 Guides used to align guide by gazing at a printed circular code anchor that's attached to a physical object in the real world.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101453">circular code anchor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101849">сидро са циркуларним кодом</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54595_3101454_3101850"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An anchor in Dynamics 365 Guides used to align guide to a digital 3D hologram that's overlaid on a physical object in the real world.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101454">holographic anchor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101850">холографско сидро</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54596_3101455_3101851"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of anchor in Dynamics 365 Guides that represents a position and orientation relative to a real-world object in an environment. It provides a common frame of reference that allows to place digital content in the same physical location of a real-world object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101455">object anchor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101851">сидро објекта</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54597_3101456_3101852"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An anchor in Dynamics 365 Guides used to align guide by gazing at a printed QR code anchor that's attached to a physical object in the real world. QR code anchoring is recommended for small to medium-size objects and spaces because it's the most accurate method, and the anchor can be printed at different sizes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101456">QR code anchor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101852">сидро са QR кодом</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54598_3101457_3101853"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Remote Assist that enables to capture and annotate a part of the environment during a call. Users can save the snapshot to their mobile device gallery, the in-call text chat, or both.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101457">snapshot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101853">снимак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54599_3101458_3101854"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A central building block for creating a guide in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Guides. After creating the structure for guide in the Outline page, Step Editor will need to be used to add instructional text and 3D models or media to support the step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101458">step</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3101854">корак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54600_3102395_3102790"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Purview feature that combines the risk scoring and user-activity approach of Insider Risk Management, with the data protection capabilities from Microsoft DLP.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3102395">Adaptive Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><