tlook, Teams, Office.com).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114829">Defender Messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115455">Defender поруке</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54813_3114829_3115456"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that leverages the new MetaOS platform to provide a single location for end-users to access quarantined and reported messages from Office applications (Outlook, Teams, Office.com).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114829">Defender Messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115456">Microsoft Defender поруке</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54814_3114837_3115452"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides an automated installation and deployment of a defined set of third-party Teams apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114837">Auto install approved apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115452">Аутоматска инсталација одобрених апликација</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54815_3114838_3115457"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to utilize Python libraries to quickly clean up data, explore the relationships within the data, and use sophisticated AI-powered libraries to analyze the data and make predictions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114838">Python in Excel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115457">Python у програму Excel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54832_3115260_3122072"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 Copilot capability that delivers relevant, actionable responses to prompts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115260">Semantic Index for Copilot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3122072">Семантички индекс за Copilot</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54833_3115363_3118316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software extension that augments the capabilities of AI systems, enabling them to interact with APIs from other software and services to retrieve real-time information, incorporate company and other business data, and perform new types of computations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115363">plugin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118316">додатна компонента</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54856_3115477_3116205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method that defines the parameters you want to use to allocate your data, including the sources, destinations, and the parameter you want to use to determine how to distribute your data. You define how much of your emissions go from where, to where.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115477">allocation method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116205">метод доделе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54857_3115478_3116206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Sustainability Manager that lets you define how to allocate your emissions using your allocation method details.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115478">allocation profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116206">профил доделе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54858_3115479_3116207"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An emission coming from a natural source, e.g. as a result of a degradation process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115479">biogenic emission</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116207">биогена емисија гасова</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54859_3115480_3116209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user-defined extended attribute that does not directly contain emission information, such as mobile combustion. Organizations can track and correlate custom dimensions to emissions impacts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115480">custom dimension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116209">прилагођена димензија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54861_3115482_3116211"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of emissions created from the waste disposal and treatment of products sold by the reporting company at the end of their life. This category includes the total expected end-of-life emissions from all products sold in the reporting year.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115482">End-of-life treatment of sold products</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116211">Третман продатих производа на крају века употребе</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54862_3115483_3116212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A value that converts one type of known transaction data into an approximate calculated value when actual usage information isn't available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115483">estimation factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116212">фактор процене</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54863_3115484_3116213"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A base-level location to attribute activity data. May contain multiple buildings and organizational units.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115484">facility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116213">објекат</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54865_3115486_3116215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Manufactured compounds that contain carbon and fluorine atoms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115486">perfluorocarbons</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116215">перфлуороугљеници</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54865_3115486_3116216"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Manufactured compounds that contain carbon and fluorine atoms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115486">perfluorocarbons</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116216">PFC-ови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54865_3115496_3116215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Manufactured compounds that contain carbon and fluorine atoms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115496">PFCs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116215">перфлуороугљеници</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54865_3115496_3116216"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Manufactured compounds that contain carbon and fluorine atoms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115496">PFCs</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116216">PFC-ови</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54866_3115487_3116217"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A measure of carbon footprint generated during the life cycle of a product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115487">product carbon footprint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116217">угљенични отисак производа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54867_3115488_3116218"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sequence of business activities and processes involved in creating a product or performing a service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115488">value chain</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116218">ланац вредности</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54868_3115489_3116219"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The data model that allows users and organizations to unify, standardize, and prepare waste sustainability data to track and achieve their net zero waste sustainability goals.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115489">waste data model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116219">модел података о отпаду</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54869_3115490_3116220"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The entity that stores information on the result of the tests for tracking chemical/contaminant levels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115490">waste quality test</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116220">испитивање квалитета отпада</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5487_26569_1503398"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Broadly, any device that performs arithmetic operations on numbers. Sophisticated calculators can be programmed for certain functions and can store values in memory, but they differ from computers in several ways: they have a fixed set of commands, they do not recognize text, they cannot retrieve values stored in a data file, and they cannot find and use values generated by a program such as a spreadsheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26569">calculator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503398">калкулатор</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54870_3115491_3116221"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The entity that describes the details of the basin from which water is being withdrawn by an entity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115491">water basin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116221">слив</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54871_3115492_3116222"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The entity that describes the analysis performed to test a water sample for a certain characteristic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115492">water quality analysis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116222">анализа квалитета воде</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54872_3115493_3116223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The entity that describes the overall water risk that measures all water-related risks, by aggregating all selected indicators from the Physical Quantity, Quality and Regulatory &amp; Reputational Risk categories. Higher values indicate higher water risk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115493">water risk index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116223">индекс ризика од воде</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5492_144959_1916721"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Category labels in a chart that, based on worksheet data, are automatically displayed on more than one line in a hierarchy. For example, the heading Produce might appear above a row with headings Tofu, Apples, and Pears.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144959">multiple-level category labels</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1916721">ознаке категорија за више нивоа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5492_144959_2527556"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Category labels in a chart that, based on worksheet data, are automatically displayed on more than one line in a hierarchy. For example, the heading Produce might appear above a row with headings Tofu, Apples, and Pears.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144959">multiple-level category labels</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2527556">ознаке категорија на више нивоа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54958_3116446_3117377"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The geographically defined boundary consisting of the countries in the European Union (EU) and the European Free Trade Association (EFTA) within which Microsoft has committed to store and process customer data for its major commercial enterprise online services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116446">EU Data Boundary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</t