lected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3144151">листа за праћење</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55449_3143318_3144150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the context of cryptocurrency, a unique identifier that functions as proof that a transaction was validated and added to the blockchain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3143318">transaction hash</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3144150">хеш трансакције</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5545_140096_1503402"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A label that provides additional information about a data marker, which represents a single data point or value that originates from a datasheet cell.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140096">data label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503402">ознака података</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55512_3143869_3146025"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"