ilt using pixels as the only building blocks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161605">pixel art</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162756">илустрација пикселима</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56226_3161606_3162760"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that makes an image or photograph look like a watercolor painting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161606">watercolor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162760">акварел</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56227_3161607_3162751"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Block print technique involves carving a design into wood or linoleum and using that block to print the design onto paper or fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161607">block print</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162751">штампа блоковима</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56228_3161608_3162759"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Steampunk images often combine elements of the Victorian era with futuristic technology, including gears, cogs, brass, and steam-powered machinery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161608">steampunk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162759">стимпанк</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56229_3161609_3162752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Claymation images use movable clay characters and are often seen in children's films and cartoons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161609">claymation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162752">анимација глином</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56230_3161610_3162750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Art deco images often blends modernity and luxury, creating a glamorous style.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161610">art deco</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162750">арт деко</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56231_3161611_3162754"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Low poly images use a limited number of polygons to represent shapes and are characterized by their simplicity and geometric shapes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161611">low poly</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162754">мали број полигона</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56232_3161612_3162755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Origami style is characterized by its minimalism, geometric shapes and creativity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161612">origami</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162755">оригами</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56233_3161613_3162757"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to take 1-2 images/photos and select a style or type a prompt and have your images combined and reimagined, generating an image with a new style.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161613">restyle image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162757">променити стил слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56233_3161613_3162758"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to take 1-2 images/photos and select a style or type a prompt and have your images combined and reimagined, generating an image with a new style.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161613">restyle image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162758">промијенити стил слике</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56234_3161614_3161649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bookable resource which is a container for the child resources who are members of the crew. Crews allow dispatchers to search and schedule multiple resources at once. Resource crews can include a group of employees, subcontractors, equipment, facilities, or any combination thereof who will perform the same work during a period of time. Crews speed up and simplify the scheduling process and allow team members to work together more consistently.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161614">crew</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161649">екипа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56235_3161615_3161691"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool used in Dynamics 365 Field Service to allocate resources, schedule jobs, manage bookings, and visually track various activities over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161615">schedule board</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161691">табла распореда</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5624_1517462_2723721"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that is displayed when users are participating in a virtual conversation and that displays a list of participants, the conversation content, and the commands and controls for managing the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1517462">instant messaging window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2723721">прозор разговора</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5624_418623_2723721"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that is displayed when users are participating in a virtual conversation and that displays a list of participants, the conversation content, and the commands and controls for managing the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418623">conversation window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2723721">прозор разговора</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56242_3161706_3166317"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An AI-powered feature that determines and selects the optimized view of each person in a meeting room by comparing multiple video sources, such as laptop and room cameras, and selecting the best video view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161706">automatic camera switching​</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3166317">аутоматско пребацивање камере</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56243_3161707_3162518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The AI-powered service in Microsoft Viva that helps individuals track and grow their key job skills, and helps organizations grow and manage talent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161707">Skills in Viva</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162518">Skills in Viva</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56243_3161707_3162519"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The AI-powered service in Microsoft Viva that helps individuals track and grow their key job skills, and helps organizations grow and manage talent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161707">Skills in Viva</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162519">Skills in Viva</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56244_3161708_3