tion. More technically, it is a Dynamic Link Library (DLL) loaded by a standard Windows application that secures secrets and sensitive operations in memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3170951">VBS enclave</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175857">VBS енклава</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56392_3170952_3174866"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization and the Windows hypervisor to create an isolated virtual environment that becomes the root of trust of the OS that assumes the kernel can be compromised.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3170952">virtualization-based security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174866">безбедност заснована на виртуелизацији</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56392_3170952_3174868"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization and the Windows hypervisor to create an isolated virtual environment that becomes the root of trust of the OS that assumes the kernel can be compromised.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3170952">virtualization-based security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">