 or VCR) into digital images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128621">video capture device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1916639">уређај за снимање видео записа</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5743_128621_2541705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A device that converts analog images (for example, from a television or VCR) into digital images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128621">video capture device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541705">уређај за хватање видео сигнала</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5759_235060_1503425"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Control Panel item that allows the user to view saved networks and reconnect to them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235060">Saved networks</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503425">Запамћене мреже</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="gramma