 disk, or data, made either for archiving purposes or for safeguarding files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="317873">backup file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503462">резервна копија</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6048_317873_2542049"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A duplicate of a program, a disk, or data, made either for archiving purposes or for safeguarding files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="317873">backup file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2542049">резервна копија датотеке</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6048_317873_2542097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A duplicate of a program, a disk, or data, made either for archiving purposes or for safeguarding files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="317873">backup file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2542097">приказ стања</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><ter