at are applied to the managed folders in users' mailboxes to control the retention and journaling of messages for messaging records management (MRM). Managed content settings define when messages that are no longer needed are to be removed or journaled (copied) to a separate storage location outside the mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397180">managed content settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="406493">поставке надгледаног садржаја</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6516_50772_1503520"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of turning data into a stream of bits. Encoding is part of the serialization process that converts data into a stream of ones and zeros.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50772">encoding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503520">кодирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6516_50772_2541479"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of turning data into a stream of bits. Encoding is part of the serialization process that converts data into a stream of ones and zeros.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50772">encoding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2541479">кодирање</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6520_91124_1503521"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect created by simple, repeating designs such as vertical or horizontal lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="91124">pattern</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503521">узорак</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6533_62030_1503522"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A postal address at which a person is normally resident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62030">home address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503522">кућна адреса</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6540_8001_1503523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Interactive or animated content used on the Internet. Active content includes ActiveX controls and web browser add-ons.</de