 a specific problem or to provide a new functionality to the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="558509">feature</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503773">особина</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9248_268851_1503774"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Files that are used to help detect harmful or unwanted software and to prevent it from installing or running on your computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="268851">definitions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503774">дефиниције</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9255_298014_1503775"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button on the message toolbar that compares the names in the To, Cc, and Bcc boxes against the names in the Address Book and against those contact folders that you've specified as Outlook Address Books.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="298014">Check Names</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sr-Cyrl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1503775">Провјерити имена</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">SRB, BIH</termNote><termNo